<h2>Asobi Review 0.8 (build 694)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Compare pairs.</b> When a host has paired two clips, arriving on the first shows both in the mode the host chose, and the playlist says which clips belong together. One compare button per playlist row replaces the A chip, the B chip and the split icon.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
